  6864                                                                                        ; X coordinate
  6865  cfb1 2082d4                 JSR .copyTwoBytesWithinVDUVariables                       ; copy two bytes
  6866  cfb4 4cb8d1                 JMP .convertPixelGraphicsCoordinatesToExternal            ; set up external coordinates for graphics
  6867                          
